Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:39.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,W12 W12 收到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whiskey-1-2. Whiskey-1-2, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备掉头返回 快回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna 180, close the distance, get back in contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have faith, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一点气流紊乱 再糟的我们都经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got us through a lot worse than some light turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.78,0:01:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.67,0:01:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦尔斯 - 求救 求救\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wellsey! - Mayday, Mayday, Mayday!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.57,0:01:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crash positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力降落在公路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm putting her down by the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,要撞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going in hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.77,0:03:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别勉强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't push yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.55,0:03:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.51,0:04:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有生还的吗 - 有两具尸体 其他不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any survivors? - Two dead, not sure about the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,散开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fan out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别浪费子弹 除非万不得已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save those rounds until you need 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人活着 提姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a breather. Tim!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.42,0:06:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 香珀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, Shumpert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.77,0:06:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,搬他出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drag him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在救他们 我们该现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's saving them. We should show ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.99,0:07:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.33,0:08:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's roll out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy does it, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.01,0:09:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的武器可比你厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine's a whole lot bigger than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在放下刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now put down your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me see your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过来 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now spin around. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice little twirl around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.67,0:09:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,活见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,金发美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.22,0:09:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, you're looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.79,0:09:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不给老朋友莫尔一个拥抱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how's about a big hug for your old pal Merle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让斯蒂文斯准备医疗室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have Stevens prep the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.65,0:10:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几名伤者 - 三名\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many? - Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一人多处骨折加严重烧伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}One with multiple fractures and severe burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个时醒时晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another in and out of consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是受了惊吓加脱水\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably shock and dehydration.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第三人呢 - 她很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the third? - She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是女的吗 - 两个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A female? - Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现她们躲在树林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found them hiding in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任务给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringing a homework assignment for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.77,0:10:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}so open the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们五分钟后到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engage in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.27,0:10:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Milton.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 米琼恩 - 我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michonne? - Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.77,0:11:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,举着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么把我们关在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we being held here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我们走 - 你还没恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We want to leave. - You're not well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.87,0:11:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且天都黑了 你该留下过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's dark. You should stay the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.78,0:11:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not for me to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会找你谈的 - 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'll talk to you. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看别的病人去 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go check on your patient, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着 你肯定难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you was wondering if I was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.42,0:11:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大概希望我死了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably hoping I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.07,0:11:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我命大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来世界比起以前变小了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess this old world gets a little smaller toward the end, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,活人越来越少了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't so many of us left to share the air, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when they found me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.08,0:12:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失血过多 快不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was near bled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,饥肠辘辘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,心里想着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking to myself a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,自杀了事可能是最好的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}might make a good last meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了就能好好休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take myself a nice long nap after.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在另一个世界等着达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for Daryl on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过我弟弟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seen my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很长时间没见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回去找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him and Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你已经离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.64,0:12:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.49,0:12:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有全身而退\N{\fnArial\fs30}not all of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他那个混球把我拷在屋顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's that prick that cuffed me to the rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他努力补救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟比我温和善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always been the sweet one, my baby brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要继续找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to keep looking,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是发生了很多事 有人牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}but things happen. People died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, Dale,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.21,0:13:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰奎 索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacqui, Sophia…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.19,0:13:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.32,0:13:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到这个消息我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他人死了 很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were more. A lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.56,0:14:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不得不离开亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to leave Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.64,0:14:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最终在一个农场落脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wind up on a farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.13,0:14:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔站了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl stepped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.27,0:14:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,成了团队里不可或缺的重要成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Became a valued member of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.87,0:14:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被尸群攻击后逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got run off by a herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,多长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,七八个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven, eight months.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.27,0:14:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和其他人走散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was separated from the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,被落下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.28,0:14:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我表示怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.47,0:14:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想从我们这得到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她坐在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she sits,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,四周有墙 头上有屋顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}four walls around her, roof over her head,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.97,0:15:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,血管里输着药\N{\fnArial\fs30}medicine in her veins,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还想知道我想从她那得到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she wants to know what I want from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你和你的哑巴朋友脱离苦海 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I plucked you and your mute here out of the dirt, blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了你们的小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saved your asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就换不来一声谢谢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用枪指着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a gun on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哑巴说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, she speaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.97,0:15:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去一年里谁没被枪指过啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who ain't had a gun on 'em in the past year, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,举手示意一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show of hands, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.82,0:15:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,香珀特 克罗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shumpert, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.89,0:15:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们被枪指过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all had a gun on y'all?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'd piss my pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,手揣在兜里向我走来 我会吓得尿裤子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if some stranger come walking up with his mitts in his pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是你们真正应该害怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd be the son of a bitch you'd really want to be scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.15,0:15:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器还我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want our weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.17,0:16:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去的路上就可以拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}On our way out the front gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show us the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直把我们锁在这个屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've kept us locked up in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.92,0:16:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看见窗户上有栏杆了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see any bars on the windows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直对你们仔细照料\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being cared for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是严加监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了保护我们的人 我们不了解你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect our people. We don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.43,0:16:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对你的了解够多了 不想再待下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know enough about you to want out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们亲眼见你把刀插进两个死人的头颅中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We watched you drive a knife into the skulls of two dead men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们变成行尸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:16:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们又没被咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't bitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.47,0:17:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管什么死法 我们都会变成行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}However we die, we all turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我解除了他们的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put them out of their misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始很难接受 但这就是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not easy news to swallow at first, but there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是囚犯 你们是贵客\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not prisoners here, you're guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们想离开 我说过 请自便\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to leave, as I said, you're free to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.87,0:17:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们傍晚后不会开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't open the gates past dusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,容易吸引行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draws too much attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.72,0:17:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是你 你需要好好睡一觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you especially, you need a solid night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的状况已经不能再多撑一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't last another day out there in your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早有人会把你们带到我那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you brought over to my place in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.62,0:17:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你额外的武器和食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extra ammo, food for the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些药品 如果需要再给你辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}some meds, keys to a vehicle if you want one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.15,0:17:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快送你们上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send you on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:17:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必多虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hard feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来伍德伯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.61,0:18:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.65,0:19:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,去后门跟皮特换岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go relieve Pete at the back gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,去操作探照灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是军队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you military?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算是 有几个老兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly. Couple of vets,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是总的来说我们是自编队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}but by and large we're self-trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拿的可是重武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's heavy artillery they're packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人来时带着枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some men arrive with guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但大多数武器都是四处搜集的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but most of the weapons are scavenged over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇子的另一边呢 其他的街道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other side of town? The rest of the streets?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,都像这里一样严防紧守吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all guarded like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.93,0:19:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且事实确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到一个行尸 总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got us a creeper, Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:19:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以用一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.09,0:20:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督 他们这么叫你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Governor? They call you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些绰号改不了 不管你想不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some nicknames stick whether you want them to or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「寸头」才是绰号 「总督」可是个头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz is a nickname. Governor is a title.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.38,0:20:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,二者不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.41,0:20:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,打中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.85,0:20:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有几个行尸伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought his buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.11,0:20:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明早去处理尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get them in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让尸体烂在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't leave them to rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.41,0:20:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样会有味道 让大家闻起来不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creates an odor. Makes people uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么大家 这里没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What people? There's nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个空镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.53,0:20:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.33,0:20:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿会更舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be more comfortable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.22,0:20:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿不是四季酒店 但能洗热水澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the Four Seasons, but there's a hot shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.87,0:21:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,水源有限 尽快洗完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water's limited, so keep it short.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有食物 水源 干净衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got food, water, fresh clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.44,0:21:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你们满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你带着刀感觉更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you'd feel better with your sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.21,0:21:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,更有安全感 但是在这儿你很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}more secure, but you're safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.67,0:21:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.67,0:21:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个飞行员怎样了 他能活下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the pilot? Will he make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯蒂文斯医生会尽她所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dr. Stevens is doing all she can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你有很多问题 但是我还有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know you got a lot more questions, but I got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.35,0:21:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你需要什么 我的人就在门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man will be outside the door if you need anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.29,0:21:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.67,0:22:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩在外太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two were out there for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.49,0:22:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在外面求生时 总督在发展这个镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you were, the Governor was doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.65,0:22:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people do you have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.92,0:22:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,七十三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}73.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.39,0:22:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾琳要生了 有了孩子就是七十四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eileen's about to pop, so her kid will make it 74.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在慢慢发展中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still a work in progress,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.75,0:22:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马也不是一天建成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Rome wasn't built in a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是大胆的类比\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a bold comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.17,0:22:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we've earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.70,0:22:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个多月没有行尸越过围墙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walls haven't been breached in well over a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.82,0:22:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,初冬开始内部就没有伤亡人员了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't suffered a casualty on the inside since early winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.05,0:22:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.62,0:22:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督设立了严格的门禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Governor set a strict curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,天黑后谁都不能出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody out after dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.62,0:22:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,声响和光亮都尽量避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noise and light are kept to the bare minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,围墙上有武装警卫巡视四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armed guards on the fence and patrolling the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.81,0:22:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让行尸无法靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep the biters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.36,0:22:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚进城时 我看到你们的巡逻队的所为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what your patrols do on the way in last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.26,0:22:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把死尸挂起来 像装饰品一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had a dead one strung up like an ornament.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会为他们辩解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't make excuses,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.01,0:22:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那些人每天都冒着生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}but those men put their lives at risk every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来保护这个镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.72,0:22:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们失去的不只是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've lost more than a few friends out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人都以自己的方式应对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody copes in their own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.79,0:23:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会跟总督说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll raise it with the Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个地方井然有序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things were orderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.99,0:23:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,四周筑有围栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fences held.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.28,0:23:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们受到保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}People were protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.15,0:23:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,并有充足的食物和贮备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food and supplies were lasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.61,0:23:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后营地中一人被咬伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one of the men inside got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.53,0:23:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,具体情况尚不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure how.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.90,0:23:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着他失去控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went haywire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.45,0:23:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,营地顿时一片恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Panic swept through the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.09,0:23:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人从大门逃了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone opened the gate to escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.69,0:23:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人被咬伤感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}others were bitten and infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.74,0:23:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们乱作一团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people went crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.97,0:23:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个地方在几小时内变成人间地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole place went to hell in a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.76,0:23:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们小队带上补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}My team grabbed whatever supplies and vehicles we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.85,0:23:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车逃离了岗哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}and abandoned our post.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.63,0:23:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中有多少人逃了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of you escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.94,0:23:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们小队有十人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was 10 in my group.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.28,0:24:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约逃到六十里开外\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got maybe 60 miles from the post.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.25,0:24:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,堵在公路上无法前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}before getting jammed up on the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.16,0:24:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我开飞机侦察前方情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took the bird up in the air to scout ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.56,0:24:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机在骚乱中受损 但我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took a beating in the riot, but we had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.31,0:24:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的伙伴呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.19,0:24:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.51,0:24:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找余下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go find the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.31,0:24:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带到这个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring them here where they'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那里等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're out there waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.37,0:24:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.03,0:24:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他们在哪儿 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where they are, and I promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.81,0:24:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they're still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.66,0:24:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把他们带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring 'em in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.14,0:25:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务完成了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you finish your homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.82,0:25:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不巧 被狗耽搁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, the dog's eating it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.15,0:25:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.98,0:25:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是学校操场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where are we, back in the school yard?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.40,0:25:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你还得势不饶人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you want to take his lunch money while you're at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.04,0:25:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.94,0:25:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我在你身上纯属浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I've wasted my time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.55,0:25:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你还是没长记性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you haven't learned anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.17,0:25:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还想在这儿抽烟 - 你也没好到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was trying to smoke in here. - And you, I expect better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,去招惹熊只会被抓伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep poking the bear and you're bound to get mauled.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.15,0:25:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,记好了 跟我说说那个女孩的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that. Tell me about the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.56,0:25:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她叫安德莉亚 - 你认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Name's Andrea. - You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.96,0:25:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是亚特兰大那伙人中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She from that group in Atlanta?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.37,0:25:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.89,0:25:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他们那伙人把我留在屋顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same one left me on the roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.85,0:25:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,害我不得不截肢\N{\fnArial\fs30}forced me to mutilate myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.12,0:25:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她认识你弟弟达里尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she know your brother Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.01,0:25:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.07,0:26:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那再找她谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then talk to her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.99,0:26:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看还能知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what else you can find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.74,0:26:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看看你的成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.30,0:26:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究的怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.33,0:26:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我大吃一惊 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, pretty impressive, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.82,0:26:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major kudos for ingenuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.64,0:26:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们的胳膊拿掉 它们就没法抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take away their arms so they can't grab you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.56,0:26:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们的下颚拿掉 它们就没法咬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take away their jaws so they can't bite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.71,0:26:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它们丧失咬人的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take away their ability to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.13,0:26:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就会失去进食的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}they lose interest in doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.30,0:26:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就不会再攻击人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're no longer in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.81,0:26:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使它们在身边 我们也不会有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can be in their presence without threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.08,0:26:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在某种程度上变温顺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're… they become docile in a sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.30,0:26:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lurkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.38,0:26:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, docile.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.76,0:26:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是潜行者 随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or lurkers. You know, whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.45,0:26:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么留着它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why keep 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.64,0:26:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,像驱虫剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, repellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.71,0:27:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.11,0:27:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,与行尸同行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk with the biters,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.33,0:27:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就会认为你也是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}they think you're a biter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.79,0:27:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,低调 妙招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Low profile. That's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.31,0:27:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们还很瘦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still pretty thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.12,0:27:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它们不吃东西 为什么不会饿死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're not eating, why don't they starve?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.20,0:27:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.70,0:27:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是来的比我们慢得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just do it slower than we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.64,0:27:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们似乎在用常识解释非常识现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels like we're trying to impose logic on chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.32,0:27:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这未尝不是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.05,0:27:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但这对我们又有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but what does it buy us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.82,0:27:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多的疑问 更多的假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}More questions, more theories,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.54,0:27:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没有答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}no answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.86,0:27:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.70,0:27:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我可以和这两个女人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could talk to those women…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.57,0:27:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔正在和她们谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle's handling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.85,0:27:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想质疑你的判断力 总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to question your judgment, Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.88,0:27:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以质疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.79,0:27:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是我需要你的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.60,0:27:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的质疑 还有你泡的茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}That and your tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.87,0:27:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.15,0:28:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.69,0:28:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让莫尔不受监控去和她们谈话是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}letting Merle talk to those women unsupervised is a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.43,0:28:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常说 每套工具里都要有一把锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you've always said every tool kit needs a hammer,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.51,0:28:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为锤子适合这项工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but do you really feel the hammer is the right tool for that job?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.21,0:28:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,八个月吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight months?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.03,0:28:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以想象两位女士在外生存了这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to believe you ladies lasted so long out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.15,0:28:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为我们是女的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're women?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.38,0:28:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们孤立无援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you were alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.51,0:28:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以彼此照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.76,0:28:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个人对抗整个末世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two against the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.63,0:28:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存机会可不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's long odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.38,0:28:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}We managed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.35,0:28:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太了不起了 - 同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, we're impressed. - Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.99,0:28:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要在野外生存可不是件容易的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival in the wild is tough sledding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.91,0:28:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天清早在地上一睁开眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up every morning on the ground wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.06,0:28:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就怕这是自己的最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}if today is the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.57,0:28:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟会是个痛快的死法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it be quick and final.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.06,0:28:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是慢慢地死去 永受折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}or slow and, well, without end?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.57,0:28:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会有人照我的脑袋来上一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will someone have the good sense to kill my brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.97,0:28:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我也会变成僵尸中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}or will I come back as one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.29,0:29:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为僵尸们是否也会有记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they remember anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.97,0:29:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,回忆起它们自己的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The person they once were?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.88,0:29:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想考虑这些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.09,0:29:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿认为它们的记忆或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton believes there might be a trace of the person they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.96,0:29:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在脑中萦绕\N{\fnArial\fs30}still trapped inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.76,0:29:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像回声一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like an echo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你可能也这样想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely it must have crossed your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.17,0:29:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么一会想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}At one time, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.28,0:29:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在它试图咬死我之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right before it tried to bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.32,0:29:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you killed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.16,0:29:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说「它」是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say "It" Only because no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.75,0:29:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这里没有人想称呼为「他」\N{\fnArial\fs30}likes to refer to them as him…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.38,0:29:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者「她」\N{\fnArial\fs30}or her. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.92,0:29:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用链子锁起来的那两个 它们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two you had in chains, who were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.80,0:29:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你控制它们的独特方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you controlled them,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.36,0:29:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它们为你所用\N{\fnArial\fs30}used them to your benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.77,0:29:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该认识它们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did know them, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.92,0:30:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她们安静地吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.56,0:30:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.08,0:30:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你能守住这个地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what you have here, you expect it to hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.53,0:30:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一尸群经过怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if a herd comes through?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.02,0:30:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能守住\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.20,0:30:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么秘诀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.91,0:30:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,高大的城墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really big walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.93,0:30:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些军人也曾有高墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That soldier had walls, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.38,0:30:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的结局我们都很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we all know how that turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.64,0:30:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的也对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.76,0:30:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的秘诀在于墙内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real secret is what goes on within these walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.32,0:30:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让人们意识到自己的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about getting back to who we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.16,0:30:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,找回真正的自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who we really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.11,0:30:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,军人们只是在企盼救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just waiting to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.87,0:30:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人们却有自己的家 有医疗服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}And people here have homes, medical care,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.38,0:30:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们可以上学 大人们拥有工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}kids go to school, adults have jobs to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.64,0:31:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都有条不紊 就像一个社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a sense of purpose. We're a community.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.41,0:31:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多枪和弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a lot of guns and ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.98,0:31:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总比没有好 - 还有高大的城墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Never hurts. - And really big walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.36,0:31:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保卫家园我们无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And men willing to risk everything to defend them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.04,0:31:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,危及这里的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compromise our safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.21,0:31:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁掉我们的社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}destroy our community,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.93,0:31:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁死也不会让这一切发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll die before I'll let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.81,0:31:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去你像在尘世之外过着悠闲的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're sitting pretty at the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.69,0:31:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看上去很悠闲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I strike you as the kind of man who sits pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.01,0:31:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,种何因 得何果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You reap what you sow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.81,0:31:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们付出了耕耘\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.97,0:31:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,冬天已过 是时候收获成果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now winter has passed, it's time to harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.49,0:31:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怕只是空想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time in a hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.17,0:31:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会夺回曾经属于我们的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going out there and we're taking back what's ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.75,0:31:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.13,0:31:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,必将重新崛起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.50,0:32:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是这次 我们不会撕咬对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only this time we won't be eating each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.07,0:32:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为重振文明干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To civilization, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.36,0:32:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.93,0:32:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,茶怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.11,0:32:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 早饭要提早结束 有急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to cut breakfast short, but this can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.74,0:32:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器还我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want our weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.70,0:32:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以让你们把食物外带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can make this meal to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.18,0:32:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器也可以双手奉上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your weapons will be waiting outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.93,0:32:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你应该先放松一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you should take time to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.60,0:32:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,恢复下体力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your strength back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.33,0:32:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处逛逛 谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a look around. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.70,0:32:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说不定会喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might like what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.46,0:33:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.97,0:33:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.65,0:33:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有信任过别人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever trusted anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.86,0:33:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.03,0:33:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就花一两天的时间试试 我就这点要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then give this a day or two, that's all I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.87,0:33:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好可以让我们休整一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some time to get our shit together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.04,0:33:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 不用休整\N{\fnArial\fs30}My shit never stopped being together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.69,0:33:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿询问你的行尸时你可不淡定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't look that way when Milton asked about your walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.93,0:33:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好没用叉子戳他眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised he didn't get a fork in his eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.47,0:33:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的行尸关他鸟事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was none of his damn business.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.70,0:33:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概也不关我事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's none of mine, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.44,0:33:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起七个月了 经历了风风雨雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven months together, all we've been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.51,0:33:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是觉得不怎么了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still feel like I hardly know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.08,0:33:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 这是事实 你了解我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, it's the truth. Come on. You know everything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.29,0:33:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.92,0:33:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些行尸整个冬天都和我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those walkers were with us all winter long,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.65,0:34:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护着我们 你却毫不犹豫地杀死它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}protecting us, and you took them out without any hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.38,0:34:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那已经 - 我比你想象的心狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That had… - It was easier than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.33,0:34:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有车接近 下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vehicle approaching, Corporal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.50,0:34:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.65,0:34:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, hey! Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.91,0:35:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,报上你的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identify yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.21,0:35:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现了你们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, hey! We found your guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.21,0:35:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔斯中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wells. Lieutenant Wells.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.34,0:35:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的直升机迫降了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His chopper went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.60,0:35:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.39,0:35:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我们住处 他受了重伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a little settlement. Now, he's badly hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.87,0:35:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.78,0:35:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人都死了 我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other guys didn't make it, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.50,0:35:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔斯说我能在这里找到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Wells, he told me I would find you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.40,0:35:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我带你们去见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wants me to bring you to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.02,0:35:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔斯在他们那里 他们找到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found Wells. They got him. They found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.86,0:35:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我们也找到了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sure did. We found you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.58,0:36:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别浪费子弹 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never waste a bullet, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.20,0:36:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器都拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick up the rest of these weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.33,0:36:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.53,0:36:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去给那个年轻人解除痛苦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go put a merciful end to that young man's days.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.12,0:37:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看大兵们都有什么好东西 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what Uncle Sam brought us, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.59,0:38:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天我们带回了三名新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We brought in three new people yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.87,0:38:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一位是国民警卫队的直升机驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}One was a helicopter pilot with a National Guard outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.91,0:38:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他弥留之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though he's clinging to life,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.56,0:38:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我们在高速路上还有他伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}he told us about his convoy on the highway,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.67,0:38:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的战友\N{\fnArial\fs30}his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.29,0:38:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向他保证 把他们活着救回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised I'd bring them back here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.53,0:38:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们没有像我们一样的高墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they didn't have our walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.28,0:38:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}or our fences.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.55,0:38:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸在我们之前找到了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biters got there before we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.78,0:38:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拥有卡车 车上有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the men had trucks, the trucks had weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.38,0:39:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物和药品 都是我们需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}food, medicine, things we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.09,0:39:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们虽然不认识他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we didn't know them,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.69,0:39:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但唯有珍惜我们拥有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'll honor their sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.99,0:39:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是对他们牺牲最大的敬意\N{\fnArial\fs30}by not taking what we have here for granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.07,0:39:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快天黑了 大家都回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't be long before dark, so go on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.48,0:39:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你们拥有的一切要心存感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be thankful for what you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.29,0:39:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.16,0:39:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.71,0:39:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么我能帮忙的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.48,0:39:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 今晚没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nothing tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.82,0:39:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,漫长的一天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long day?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.12,0:39:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近没有一天不漫长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't had many short ones lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.90,0:39:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.96,0:39:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's your real name?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.25,0:39:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你真名叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's not asking too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.19,0:40:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.78,0:40:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡事无绝对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never say never.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.32,0:40:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
